config BR2_PACKAGE_CADR_DISK_PACK
	bool "cadr-disk-pack"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_CADR_COMMON
	help
	  The disk pack program: the program on the processing system that serves
	  the CADR's disk from the pack file on the card, with the init
	  script that mounts the card and starts it.  One package per
	  program, decided 10 Sep: the console, the RFB server, the Chaosnet
	  bridge and USB input each get their own beside this one, and what
	  they share goes into a cadr-common package when the second arrives.
	  The second arrived on 10 Sep and cadr-common is that package.
